{"availability":"available","full":"scccc6ut/npface","name":"npface","description":"会表情的 AI头像 — expressive, zero-dependency helmet avatar for AI agents (MIT)","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":95,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-19T12:38:20Z","updated":"2026-08-20T01:39:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://scccc6ut.github.io/npface/","topics":["ai-agent","animation","avatar","emotion","npcrew","react","svg","typescript"],"demo":"https://scccc6ut.github.io/npface/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:58.868Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:21:21.302Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T21:06:20.301Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T01:07:34.562Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T20:53:29.941Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.387Z","stars":95,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","stars":95,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["表情头盔 · 会表情的 AI 员工头像 An expressive, zero-dependency SVG helmet avatar for AI agents.","npface renders a small helmet-shaped face — a deep-navy rounded square helmet, white visor slot, two neon-green rounded-square eyes (the npcrew brand mark, flat 2D) — and makes it emote. Expressions come entirely from the two eyes, the visor and tiny helmet motions: blinks, squint-smiles, wide eyes, side glances, sleepy half-lids, reading saccades, a radar-like \"searching\" circle, dizzy X-eyes, z z z, nods, head tilts, breathing.","Give it a semantic state name and it takes care of the rest:"],"features":["13 states: sleep · wake · idle · blink · happy · proud (complete) · thinking · search-docs · search-web · working · waiting · error (dizzy) · sad (tired) — plus aliases (searching, rag, browsing, tired …; searchDocs /…","Zero dependencies, framework-agnostic core (plain SVG/DOM, built-in springs & easing, one shared requestAnimationFrame loop). 9 KB gzip.","React bindings (npface-react): . Vue can follow.","Alive by default: breathing, random glances, auto-blink, per-state rhythm; optional eyes-follow-pointer.","Considerate: pauses off-screen (IntersectionObserver), honours prefers-reduced-motion (static poses + minimal transitions), role=\"img\" + aria-label."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scccc6ut/npface/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fd476fc7d2649f9e39c75f1f5b6df23a15a3d1b60d0595de05eb0820684d6400","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:00:28.874Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.531Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-20T01:39:26Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"表情头盔 · 会表情的 AI 员工头像 An expressive, zero-dependency SVG helmet avatar for AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scccc6ut/npface/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"fd476fc7d2649f9e39c75f1f5b6df23a15a3d1b60d0595de05eb0820684d6400","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scccc6ut/npface/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.532Z"},"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:59.219Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scccc6ut/npface/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.533Z","hash":"fd476fc7d2649f9e39c75f1f5b6df23a15a3d1b60d0595de05eb0820684d6400","originalBytes":29756,"storedBytes":29756,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:53.933Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:53.933Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/516b85bc2c40b41ab1301961.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T12:17:50.645Z","url":"https://scccc6ut.github.io/npface/"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://scccc6ut.github.io/npface/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T12:17:50.645Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T12:17:50.645Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T1